---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — HighJack"
  description="Why HighJack exists: a configurable, deterministic, multiplayer board game built in the open."
>
  <header class="border-b border-line-subtle pb-12">
    <h1 class="m-0 font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl">About HighJack</h1>
    <p class="mb-0 mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-400">
      Most property-board games come with one fixed rulebook. HighJack lets the table choose its
      own rules before the first roll.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="border-b border-line-subtle py-14" aria-label="Project story">
    <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-400">
      <p class="m-0">
        The name is a nod to hitting the jackpot and taking it from someone else. It is play money
        only. The game is about making calculated risks with people you know.
      </p>
      <p class="m-0">
        The current release is one table: dice, property, rent, tax and bankruptcy. The engine
        decides every outcome on the server from a seeded stream, so the same actions always lead
        to the same match. That makes results checkable and keeps the browser honest.
      </p>
      <p class="m-0">
        Further systems are designed but not playable yet. Each one is marked with its status on
        the
        <a class="text-gold-400 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-cream-100" href="/features"
          >features page</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-line-subtle py-14" aria-labelledby="stack-title">
    <h2 id="stack-title" class="m-0 font-display text-2xl text-cream-100 sm:text-3xl">Built with</h2>
    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <article class="border-t border-line-subtle pt-4">
        <h3 class="m-0 font-display text-base font-semibold text-cream-100">Astro and SolidJS</h3>
        <p class="mb-0 mt-2 text-sm text-muted-400">
          The website is static HTML. The game client is a Solid app.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="border-t border-line-subtle pt-4">
        <h3 class="m-0 font-display text-base font-semibold text-cream-100">PixiJS</h3>
        <p class="mb-0 mt-2 text-sm text-muted-400">The board is drawn on a canvas.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="border-t border-line-subtle pt-4">
        <h3 class="m-0 font-display text-base font-semibold text-cream-100">Go</h3>
        <p class="mb-0 mt-2 text-sm text-muted-400">
          The rules engine and the WebSocket server run in one process.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="border-t border-line-subtle pt-4">
        <h3 class="m-0 font-display text-base font-semibold text-cream-100">Bun</h3>
        <p class="mb-0 mt-2 text-sm text-muted-400">
          One toolchain for the workspaces, tests and builds.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-14" aria-label="Open source">
    <h2 class="m-0 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-cream-100">Open source</h2>
    <p class="mb-0 mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-400">
      The engine, protocol, tooling and this site are MIT-licensed at
      <a
        href="https://github.com/analeis/highjack"
        class="text-gold-400 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-cream-100"
      >
        github.com/analeis/highjack
      </a>
      . The architecture notes and audit history are in the repository.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
